{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and perimeter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0226c0f384ef1d88d652562b3ebc2805f1f2c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac A{P^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"19\" height=\"21\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39f6ba583f6159aadcb898b5f7677688db8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the length and width of the rectangle, respectively. The area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3060ee7b20733c0d45ea8a8b96d8cc44851fb23e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$lw$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and the perimeter of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/e/76ed31840dbcf6acbbdf6744fb137bf86705bddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l+2w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. We wish to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb726373754936c4fd5f989570f7b03a3c343e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{lw}{(2l+2w)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"83\" height=\"42\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBy the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_Inequality\" title=\"AM-GM Inequality\">AM-GM Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f7263bf440655f274e5c0f4bea0bc009ed961d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{l+w}{2} \\ge \\sqrt{lw}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />, with equality occurring when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b77d7b3a3650930c886b25f249df0b083262b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = w$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. Multiply both sides by 4 to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f88151f515d6a8b0a2ca38e1bebc6bfeea7dc075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l+2w \\ge 4\\sqrt{lw}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBecause the length and width of a rectangle is positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d67a7e642f38b68ddac953a699db243fd0b34ad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2l+2w \\ge 4\\sqrt{lw} &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, squaring both sides would not affect the inequality sign, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73a535a82829a04914c3b24a727ac6051d92fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2l+2w)^2 \\ge 16lw$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"19\" />. Finally, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d839f9ffc72cf677a5b86f06b9a18dd8edc332b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2l+2w)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"19\" /> is positive, we can divide both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d839f9ffc72cf677a5b86f06b9a18dd8edc332b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2l+2w)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7359501810fef7d86da34669458f2d53c016a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{lw}{(2l+2w)^2} \\le \\frac{1}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"130\" height=\"42\" />. The equality case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b77d7b3a3650930c886b25f249df0b083262b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l = w$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> satisfies the equality statement, so the highest possible ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdbf3a5d28b40defc7a0dd417b8f6d282bc60de6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/0124053b521f42c49a0be698c354c9d6d27a9cba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = \\boxed{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\